{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-1","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「批次分组」：把子代理会话按创建时间聚合，间隔不超过 120 秒视为同一批，并分成本次、上次、今日和历史。打开原生下拉时，本次保持展开，其余组可点击折叠。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:662-705","lib/client.js:107-180"]}
{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-2","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「删除子代理」：在会话行尾菜单中选择删除并确认，可移除单个子代理会话；运行中的会话会先停止。删除后列表隐藏该行并同步顶部计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:310-390","lib/index.js:87-145"]}
{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-3","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「整组删除」：点击分组标题的操作菜单，可一次提交该组会话删除并确认。结果会更新本地隐藏记录和计数，失败项目会提示用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-470","lib/index.js:173-206"]}
{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-4","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「逐任务模型选择」：subagent 调用显式指定 provider、model 或 reasoning_effort 时，插件将选择传到启动流程，并按当前允许列表或模型目录校验路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/model-sync.js:67-101","lib/model-sync.js:126-168"]}
{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#caveat-1","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 使用前须知：删除操作会移除会话文件且不可恢复；由于父会话目录记录采用追加式日志，被删行只在本机隐藏，其他设备或清除本地缓存后可能再次出现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-141","lib/client.js:16-28","lib/client.js:310-350"]}
{"unit_id":"Kadima-code__dsh-subagent-toolkit#caveat-2","repo":"Kadima-code/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"59e2f3a0f1cec72748152b71e45794de83f90d4d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 使用前须知：模型同步可通过 DSF_MODEL_SYNC_OFF=1 或插件目录中的 .model-sync-off 文件关闭；关闭后分组与删除功能仍由其他模块提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/model-sync.js:8-24","lib/model-sync.js:55-58"]}
